ltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Astute_Alchemist\" title=\"Named item sets\">Astute Alchemist</a>:</b> While wearing two pieces from the Astute Alchemist set, you gain:<span style=\"text-align:left;\"><ul><li>+6% Artifact bonus to Fire, Poison, and Acid Spell Critical Chance</li><li>+30 Artifact bonus to Fire, Poison, and Acid Spell Power</li></ul></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Neck Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Neck Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Alchemist%27s_Pendant.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Alchemist%27s_Pendant.png/420px-Legendary_Alchemist%27s_Pendant.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"546\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Alchemist%27s_Pendant.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Nearly_Finished\" title=\"Nearly Finished\">Nearly Finished</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>House Cannith alchemists often wear charms such as this to ward against the deadly materials they work with. It also boosts the wearer's ability to utilize his or her energy more efficiently.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>Legendary Elemental Energy: stacking (except with itself) +150 maximum spell points.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817212954\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.112 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.176 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5347/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 46508/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16409/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n120.86%  181.968     73 Template:IO\n100.00%  150.557      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  150.557      1 -total\n 96.26%  144.928      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 39.23%   59.058      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 38.68%   58.236      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.10%   57.358      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 37.44%   56.367      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.81%   34.347     13 Template:Popup\n 12.58%   18.945      2 Template:Augment\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:82618-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817212954 and revision id 631766. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
